{"id":"hs-polyphone-001","category":"polyphone","text":"彼は行った","phonemes":["k","a","r","e","w","a","i","q","t","a"],"accent":["H","L","L","H","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[3],"notes":"行った=いった (go, past). 彼(かれ)=尾高型1→HL, は=L. 行った=頭高1→HLL. Contrast with hs-polyphone-002 (行った=おこなった)."}
{"id":"hs-polyphone-002","category":"polyphone","text":"会議を行った","phonemes":["k","a","i","g","i","w","o","o","k","o","n","a","q","t","a"],"accent":["L","H","H","H","L","H","H","H","H"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[4],"notes":"行った=おこなった (perform, past). 会議=平板→LHHH, を=H. おこなった=平板→LHHHH. Same surface 行った as hs-polyphone-001 but different reading; canonical polyphone case."}
{"id":"hs-polyphone-003","category":"polyphone","text":"戸が開いた","phonemes":["t","o","g","a","a","i","t","a"],"accent":["H","L","H","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[2],"notes":"開いた=あいた (open intransitive, past). Contrast: 開いた=ひらいた (open transitive) would give different phonemes. 戸=尾高1→HL. あいた=頭高1→HLL."}
{"id":"hs-counter-001","category":"counter","text":"本を10冊","phonemes":["h","o","N","w","o","j","u","q","s","a","ts","u"],"accent":["H","L","L","H","L","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[3],"notes":"10冊=じゅっさつ (rendaku + sokuon on 冊). 本(book)=頭高1→HL, を=L. じゅっさつ=頭高1→HLLL. Alt reading じっさつ acceptable in older Tokyo."}
{"id":"hs-counter-002","category":"counter","text":"犬が3匹","phonemes":["i","n","u","g","a","s","a","N","b","i","k","i"],"accent":["L","H","L","H","L","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[3],"notes":"3匹=さんびき (rendaku 匹→びき). 犬=尾高2→LH, が drops→L. さんびき=頭高1→HLLL. Rendaku pattern differs from 1匹(いっぴき)/2匹(にひき)."}
{"id":"hs-counter-003","category":"counter","text":"100円","phonemes":["h","y","a","k","u","e","N"],"accent":["L","H","H","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[],"notes":"100円=ひゃくえん. Accent type 3 (nucleus on く)→LHHL. Not 平板 in NHK accent dict. 1 mora ひゃ = single mora despite 2 chars."}
{"id":"hs-proper_noun-001","category":"proper_noun","text":"山田さんは","phonemes":["y","a","m","a","d","a","s","a","N","w","a"],"accent":["L","H","H","H","H","H"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[],"notes":"山田=平板→LHH. さん suffix 平板継続→HHH. は topic particle after 平板→H (no drop). Common surname; used as sanity check."}
{"id":"hs-proper_noun-002","category":"proper_noun","text":"大阪へ","phonemes":["o","o","s","a","k","a","e"],"accent":["H","L","L","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[],"notes":"大阪=頭高1→HLLL. へ particle after 頭高→L. Note phoneme surface: 大阪=おおさか (o o s a k a), not おうさか."}
{"id":"hs-proper_noun-003","category":"proper_noun","text":"田中先生","phonemes":["t","a","n","a","k","a","s","e","N","s","e","e"],"accent":["L","H","H","L","H","H","H"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[3],"notes":"田中=平板→LHH. 先生=平板→LHHH. Long vowel せんせい canonicalized as s e N s e e (vowel repetition, per CLAUDE.md). Two accent phrases (name + honorific title)."}
{"id":"hs-loanword-001","category":"loanword","text":"コンピュータ","phonemes":["k","o","N","p","y","u","u","t","a"],"accent":["L","H","H","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[],"notes":"コンピュータ=こんぴゅーた (5 moras: ko-N-pyu-u-ta). Accent type 3→LHHLL (nucleus on ぴゅ). ぴゅー long vowel = pyu + u (moraic long)."}
{"id":"hs-loanword-002","category":"loanword","text":"スマートフォン","phonemes":["s","u","m","a","a","t","o","f","o","N"],"accent":["L","H","L","L","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[],"notes":"スマートフォン=すまーとふぉん (6 moras). Accent type 2→LHLLLL (nucleus on ま). Long vowel まー=m a + a. フォ=f o (extended JULIUS for foreign syllable)."}
{"id":"hs-loanword-003","category":"loanword","text":"アプリケーション","phonemes":["a","p","u","r","i","k","e","e","sh","o","N"],"accent":["L","H","H","H","L","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[],"notes":"アプリケーション=あぷりけーしょん (7 moras). Accent type 4→LHHHLLL (nucleus on け). しょ=sh o. Long vowel けー=k e + e."}
{"id":"hs-numeric_unit-001","category":"numeric_unit","text":"10km走る","phonemes":["j","u","q","k","i","r","o","h","a","sh","i","r","u"],"accent":["H","L","L","L","L","H","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[4],"notes":"10km=じゅっきろ (数詞+単位 rendaku). Reading じゅっきろ preferred over じっきろ in modern Tokyo. Accent 頭高→HLLL. 走る=頭高2→HLL. km=キロ (not キロメートル in this short form)."}
{"id":"hs-numeric_unit-002","category":"numeric_unit","text":"3GBの","phonemes":["s","a","N","g","i","g","a","b","a","i","t","o","n","o"],"accent":["L","H","H","H","H","H","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[],"notes":"3GB=さんぎがばいと. GB expanded to full unit reading ギガバイト (curator choice; alt: alphabet reading ジービー). Compound accent 3+ギガバイト→LHHHHHHLL (nucleus on と-の). Requires unit-expansion normalization module."}
{"id":"hs-numeric_unit-003","category":"numeric_unit","text":"2025年に","phonemes":["n","i","s","e","N","n","i","j","u","u","g","o","n","e","N","n","i"],"accent":["L","H","H","H","H","H","H","H","H","H"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[],"notes":"2025年=にせんにじゅうごねん (year reading, not digit-by-digit). Compound number+counter →平板 LHHHHHHHHH. に particle after 平板→H. 4-digit year normalization must trigger 千 combining form."}
{"id":"hs-english_mixed-001","category":"english_mixed","text":"iPhoneを買った","phonemes":["a","i","f","o","N","w","o","k","a","q","t","a"],"accent":["H","L","L","L","L","H","L","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[5],"notes":"iPhone→アイフォン (loanword transcription; katakana convention). Accent 頭高1→HLLL, を=L. 買った=頭高1→HLL. Tests Kanalizer-style English→Japanese phonetic mapping."}
{"id":"hs-english_mixed-002","category":"english_mixed","text":"PDFを開く","phonemes":["p","i","i","d","i","i","e","f","u","w","o","h","i","r","a","k","u"],"accent":["L","H","H","L","L","L","L","L","H","H"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[7],"notes":"PDF→ピーディーエフ (alphabet spelling read). Accent type 3→LHHLLLL, を=L. 開く=平板→LHH. でぃ=d i (extended JULIUS for foreign-origin syllable). Tests abbreviation-vs-word disambiguation (PDF is spelled, not read as 'ピディエフ')."}
{"id":"hs-english_mixed-003","category":"english_mixed","text":"Wi-Fi接続","phonemes":["w","a","i","f","a","i","s","e","ts","u","z","o","k","u"],"accent":["H","L","L","L","L","H","H","H"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[4],"notes":"Wi-Fi→ワイファイ (proper noun loanword). Accent 頭高1→HLLL. 接続=平板→LHHH. ふぁ=f a (extended JULIUS). Hyphen not spoken."}
{"id":"hs-english_abbreviation-001","category":"english_abbreviation","text":"AIエンジニア","phonemes":["e","e","a","i","e","N","j","i","n","i","a"],"accent":["L","H","H","L","L","H","H","H","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[4],"notes":"AI=エーアイ (alphabet spelling: A→エー, I→アイ). Accent type 3→LHHL. エンジニア=accent 4→LHHHL (nucleus on に). Tests alphabet-reading rule for 2-letter abbreviations."}
{"id":"hs-english_abbreviation-002","category":"english_abbreviation","text":"NASAが発表","phonemes":["n","a","s","a","g","a","h","a","q","p","y","o","u"],"accent":["H","L","L","L","H","H","H"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[3],"notes":"NASA=ナサ (WORD-reading, not spelled ‘エヌエーエスエー’). Accent 頭高1→HLL, が=L. 発表=平板→LHHH (5 moras: は-Q-ぴょ-う). Tests spell-vs-word abbreviation classification."}
{"id":"hs-english_abbreviation-003","category":"english_abbreviation","text":"HTMLタグ","phonemes":["e","i","ch","i","t","i","i","e","m","u","e","r","u","t","a","g","u"],"accent":["L","H","H","H","H","H","H","H","L","H","L"],"accent_phrase_boundaries":[9],"notes":"HTML=エイチティーエムエル (alphabet spelling, 4 letters × 2-3 moras). H=エイチ, T=ティー, M=エム, L=エル. Accent 8→LHHHHHHHL (nucleus on る). タグ=頭高1→HL. ティ=t i, ち=ch i (JULIUS). Tests long alphabet-abbreviation reading rule."}
{"id": "hs-polyphone-004", "category": "polyphone", "text": "生の魚", "phonemes": ["n", "a", "m", "a", "n", "o", "s", "a", "k", "a", "n", "a"], "accent": ["L", "H", "H", "H", "H", "H"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [], "notes": "生=なま (raw/fresh noun, 6 moras). Contrast hs-polyphone-005 (生=せい in 学生 compound), -006 (生=いき in 生きる verb). Single AP 平板."}
{"id": "hs-polyphone-005", "category": "polyphone", "text": "学生の頃", "phonemes": ["g", "a", "k", "u", "s", "e", "e", "n", "o", "k", "o", "r", "o"], "accent": ["L", "H", "H", "H", "H", "H", "L"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [5], "notes": "生=せい (Sino-Japanese reading in 学生 compound, 7 moras). Long vowel せい canonicalized s e e. 学生=平板, 頃=頭高1 HL."}
{"id": "hs-polyphone-006", "category": "polyphone", "text": "生きる意味", "phonemes": ["i", "k", "i", "r", "u", "i", "m", "i"], "accent": ["L", "H", "H", "H", "L"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [3], "notes": "生=いき (verb 生きる=いきる kun-yomi, 5 moras). Third polyphonic reading of 生. Verb 平板, 意味 頭高1."}
{"id": "hs-polyphone-007", "category": "polyphone", "text": "一日中忙しい", "phonemes": ["i", "ch", "i", "n", "i", "ch", "i", "j", "u", "u", "i", "s", "o", "g", "a", "sh", "i", "i"], "accent": ["L", "H", "H", "H", "H", "H", "L", "H", "H", "H", "L"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [6], "notes": "一日=いちにち (whole-day compound, 11 moras). Contrast hs-polyphone-008 (一日=ついたち date reading). 忙しい accent 4."}
