{"id": "hs-polyphone-009", "category": "polyphone", "text": "上手な絵", "phonemes": ["j", "o", "o", "z", "u", "n", "a", "e"], "accent": ["L", "H", "H", "L", "H"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [4], "notes": "上手=じょうず (skillful, 5 moras). Contrast hs-polyphone-010 (上手=うわて). じょうず 尾高3, 絵 頭高1."}
{"id": "hs-polyphone-010", "category": "polyphone", "text": "上手を取る", "phonemes": ["u", "w", "a", "t", "e", "w", "o", "t", "o", "r", "u"], "accent": ["L", "H", "H", "H", "H", "L"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [4], "notes": "上手=うわて (upper-hand, sumo/game term, 6 moras). Same surface as hs-polyphone-009 (じょうず) but different reading. うわて 平板."}
{"id": "hs-polyphone-011", "category": "polyphone", "text": "何時に来る", "phonemes": ["n", "a", "N", "j", "i", "n", "i", "k", "u", "r", "u"], "accent": ["H", "L", "L", "L", "H", "L"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [4], "notes": "何=なん (in 何時=なんじ, 6 moras). Contrast hs-polyphone-012 (何=なに). 何時 頭高1, 来る 頭高1."}
