{"id": "hs-counter-009", "category": "counter", "text": "旅行3日目", "phonemes": ["r", "y", "o", "k", "o", "u", "m", "i", "q", "k", "a", "m", "e"], "accent": ["L", "H", "H", "H", "L", "L", "L"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [3], "notes": "3日=みっか (day-counter sokuon; NOT さんにち which is for day-count only, 7 moras). Contrast hs-counter-010 4日=よっか (also sokuon)."}
