{"id": "hs-counter-011", "category": "counter", "text": "8日に会う", "phonemes": ["y", "o", "u", "k", "a", "n", "i", "a", "u"], "accent": ["L", "H", "H", "H", "H", "L"], "accent_phrase_boundaries": [4], "notes": "8日=ようか (irregular day-counter reading, 6 moras). Not はちにち. Sokuon absent unlike 3日/4日 — special native reading."}
